    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="150" width="380" height="80">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>作为博客读者，我希望在阅读长文章时能够看到当前的阅读进度，以便了解还剩多少内容，合理安排阅读时间。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="85" width="420" height="160">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgba(191,215,255,1)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="100" width="380" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="16" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)" bold="true"><p>验收条件</p></content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="520" startY="135" endX="600" endY="135">
      <border color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" width="2"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="150" width="380" height="80">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <ul>
          <li><p>文章详情页顶部显示固定进度条</p></li>
